yle=\"font-size:15px\">PC\u2019s</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#11DD21\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">-James, Spring Court Incubus</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#11DD21\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">-Killed Keeper via stabbing.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#11DD21\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">-Fetch still alive, but older, unknown to James.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#11DD21\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">-Librarian at Robinson Library.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1CFFD5\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">-Ultima, Summer Court Venombite</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1CFFD5\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">-Keeper still alive. </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1CFFD5\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">-Fetch, strangled, in front of family. Wanted man.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1CFFD5\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">-Makes swords for Freehold/Rapiers for the Fencing Club.</span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/863-doctor-lazarus","name":"Doctor Lazarus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}